OL,5,G0800 Sunday Supplement
OL,6,     FJennifer Jones with political
OL,7,     Fnews, discussions and analysis
OL,8,     Ffrom Wales, the UK and the world.
OL,9,G0900 All Things Considered
OL,10,     FTir Dewi, a Welsh charity
OL,11,     Fsupporting farmers, has been
OL,12,     Fnominated for the BBC 'Make a
OL,13,     FDifference' Awards. Rosa Hunt
OL,14,     Fexplores the challenges farmers
OL,15,     Fface and how Tir Dewi can help.
